Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$F00,-1,$00F,,$FF0
Print #1,Colour(1);Colour(2);Colour(3);Colour(5)
Default Palette $111,$222,$333
Ink 1 : Plot 10,10 : Polyline To 50,10 To 50,50 To 10,10
Ink 3 : Polyline 60,10 To 100,10 To 100,50
Ink 5 : Plot 120,60 : Polygon To 160,60 To 140,90
Polygon 200,10 To 260,10 To 230,70 To 200,10
Channel 2 To Bob 3 : Channel 3 To Screen Display 1 : Channel 4 To Rainbow 2
Channel 5 To Screen Offset 7 : Channel 6 To Screen Size 0 : Channel 7 To Sprite 63
Channel 8 To Bob 64
Polyline 1,1
Fade 0
Fade 1,$F00 : Wait 30 : Print #1,Colour(0)
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/graphics3_1.iff"
Palette 1.5
Print #1,Colour(0)
